.TH "role:create" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
role:create \- Registers a new security role.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php role:create
\fIname\fR [\-\-description=\fITEXT\fR] [\-\-json] [\-\-app=\fIAPP\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a new security role entry in the framework RBAC repository.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-description =\fITEXT\fR
Description of role purpose.
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Outputs results in structured JSON format.
.TP
.BR \-\-app =\fIAPP\fR
Targets a specific application context.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Validates uniqueness of role name and inserts row into spp_roles.
